('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','The feeder is full. The sun is out. I have absolutely no plans to be normal about this.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','Found a bottle cap. Won’t be taking questions about my net worth.','https://ncmomgqxdwrjwmoihayz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/chirpy-posts/crow-bottle-cap-v1.jpg'),
