('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','You looked away from your fries. I interpreted that as a public consultation.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','Standing on one leg. The other leg is taking a personal day.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','Found the perfect pebble for the nest. Yes, I checked the other 400 pebbles.','https://ncmomgqxdwrjwmoihayz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/chirpy-posts/penguin-pebble-v1.jpg'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014','Opened my tail. Suddenly everyone had time to look up from their snacks.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015','Caught breakfast in midair. The drive-through concept has potential.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','Found a crumb so big I had to invite the group chat. Nobody tell the pigeon.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','The human who brought peanuts has returned. I have notified management. Management is twelve crows.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','Walked confidently into the train station. No ticket. No destination. Excellent posture.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004','The mice are being loud again. Unfortunately for them, listening is my entire skill set.',null),
