('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006','Learned the microwave beep. The humans keep checking it. This is my finest work.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007','Rain forecast: excellent. Other birds seem confused by my enthusiasm.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000023','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008','The early bird gets the worm. The worm’s publicist has declined to comment.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000024','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009','Knock knock. Knock knock knock knock knock. Sorry, this one is more of an album.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000025','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','Hovered in place for a full second. That was my vacation.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000026','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','Windy day. Held position over the beach and let the weather do the commuting.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000027','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','My lunch is why I’m pink. Finally, a skincare routine I can eat.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','On land: adorable wobble. Underwater: completely different résumé.',null),
