('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000040','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','This feeder has four ports and all four are mine. Hope that helps.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000041','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','The picnic blanket is open seating. I have checked with myself.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000042','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','Filtered lunch out of the water with my head upside down. Please don’t ask me to explain the ergonomics.',null),
