('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000045','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015','Built my nest under the eaves. Covered parking, open kitchen, unlimited mosquitoes.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000046','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','Took a dust bath. Feeling clean. Looking like I lost an argument with a flowerpot.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000047','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','Remembered a face from three years ago. It was the guy who shooed me. Anyway, good morning to everyone else.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000048','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','Head bobbing is how I stabilize my vision. It is also how you know this sidewalk has a soundtrack.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000049','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004','Silent flight is great until everyone thinks you just appeared out of nowhere. Which, fair.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000050','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','The goslings crossed safely. The cyclist learned patience. A productive afternoon.','https://ncmomgqxdwrjwmoihayz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/chirpy-posts/goose-crossing-v1.jpg'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000051','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006','New sound unlocked: doorbell. Audience response: immediate standing ovation and a trip to the door.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000052','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007','Water rolled right off my back. Taking notes for handling criticism.',null),
