('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000054','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009','Renovating a cavity. No contractors. No permits. One extremely committed beak.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000055','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','Flew backward out of a disagreement. Highly recommend.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000056','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','Dropped a shell from the air until it opened. Sometimes the recipe is just gravity.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000057','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','The flock synchronized our head turns. No rehearsal. Just excellent group chemistry.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000058','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','Tobogganed to work on my belly. Commute improved. Dignity unchanged.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000059','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014','Someone said ‘a bit much.’ I have several hundred feathers that disagree.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000060','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015','Drank from the pond without landing. Efficiency is a lifestyle.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000061','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','The human refilled the feeder while I was watching. Finally, some accountability.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000062','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','Used a stick to get a snack. Tool use is impressive until you realize the tool was also a snack candidate.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000063','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','Flew home from somewhere I’d never been. Still can’t find the good crumb I dropped two seconds ago.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000064','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004','Morning routine: find shade, close eyes, ignore the robin’s podcast.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000065','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','If you can hear me, you are too close. If you can’t hear me, give it a second.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000066','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006','Held a snack with my foot today. Multitasking remains a core strength.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000067','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007','The pond has a new leaf. Investigated thoroughly. It is a leaf.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000068','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008','Built a nest with mud and grass. The mud is structural. Please stop calling it rustic.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000069','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009','My tail is a kickstand. My feet are clamps. I am basically a tiny ladder with opinions.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000070','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','Tiny nest made of spider silk. Stretchy walls. The housing market could learn something.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000071','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','Followed a fishing boat. Networking event had excellent catering.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000072','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','Built a mud mound for the egg. Minimalist nursery. Waterfront views.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000073','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','Another penguin borrowed a nest stone. ‘Borrowed’ is doing a lot of work here.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000074','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014','My call carries a long way. Beauty should also have an announcement system.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000075','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015','The insects are low over the field today. Changing altitude, keeping lunch plans.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000076','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','Practiced my song on the fence. Same three notes. Sold-out hedge.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000077','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','Someone called my collection ‘trash.’ That someone has no eye for bottle-cap futures.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000078','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','The statue and I have a long-standing arrangement. I sit. It says nothing. Ideal roommate.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000079','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004','Dinner arrived with its own tiny footsteps. Five stars for the delivery tracking.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000080','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Mowed the lawn with my face. Waiting for the parks department to recognize my contribution.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000081','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006','They covered my cage for bedtime. I said ‘good morning.’ Negotiations are ongoing.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000082','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007','Followed the leader across the pond. The leader was following me. We have invented a roundabout.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000083','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008','Found berries and immediately forgot every worm I have ever met.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000084','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009','Drumming is how I announce my territory. Apparently the human announces theirs by closing the window.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000085','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','Went into torpor overnight. Please allow a moment for the nectar system to reboot.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000086','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','Screamed at the ocean. It screamed back. Good meeting.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000087','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','Woke up pink. Maintained pink. Strong consistency across the brand.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000088','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','Recognized my partner’s call in a very loud colony. Still pretending not to hear the neighbor.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000089','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014','Displayed for a peahen. She continued eating. Tough room.','https://ncmomgqxdwrjwmoihayz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/chirpy-posts/peacock-display-v1.jpg'),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000090','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015','Met the flock on a wire. Nobody booked seats. Somehow everyone has a favorite.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000091','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','There are six perfectly good branches here and we all want the same one.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000092','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','Family meeting on the power line. Agenda: walnuts. Minutes: mostly yelling.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000093','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','Rain stopped. Puddle opened. Bath reservations are first come, first flapped.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000094','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004','Not brooding. Resting facial disc.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000095','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','My partner and I have been together for years. Our shared hobby is objecting to things.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000096','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006','I know four words and the exact sound of your phone ringing. Choose your next move carefully.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000097','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007','Preened every feather. Got back in the water. This is called work-life balance.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000098','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008','My territory starts at this fence and ends wherever I finish singing.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009','Found a hollow branch. Great tone. Terrible resale value.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000100','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','The red flower was empty. Betrayal looks different when you weigh less than a coin.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','That sandwich was unattended for almost half a second. You have to be decisive in this market.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','Someone asked if I ever get tired of standing around. They were sitting around when they asked.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000103','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','Wore the same outfit again. Formalwear is timeless.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014','Preening is maintenance. Strutting is distribution.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000105','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015','Returned to last year’s nesting spot. The human is calling it their porch again.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000106','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','Small bird. Big appetite. Extremely limited understanding of personal space.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000107','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','Dropped a walnut onto the road and let a car open it. Outsourcing is going well.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000108','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003','Courtship update: puffed my chest and walked in a circle. Waiting for the reviews.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000109','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004','It is 2 a.m. The woods are quiet. Finally, reasonable business hours.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000110','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','There is a sign saying ‘please keep off the grass.’ Interesting feedback. Declined.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000111','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006','You said it was a secret. You did not say it was copyrighted.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000112','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007','Please bring peas to the pond. Bread is a disappointing plot twist.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000113','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008','Dawn chorus set list: same song, louder song, same song from the other branch.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000114','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009','Worked on the same tree all morning. Calling it a focused sprint.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','Someone asked me to slow down. I checked my wings. No such setting.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000116','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011','Beach report: three chips, one crab, and a human who underestimated my reach.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000117','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012','The water is shallow and the gossip is deep.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000118','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013','Fish for breakfast. Fish for lunch. Keeping dinner a surprise.',null),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000119','00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014','Caught my reflection in the pond. Excellent taste, that bird.',null),
